### example_application — API test index
###
### This is a convenience index, not a duplicate of the per-adapter test
### files. Open the file for the adapter you're running:
###
###   Fiber: module/example-module/api/example_api.http
###   Gin:   module/example-ginapi-module/api/example_api.http
###
### Both cover the same 5 example-resource CRUD endpoints (identical routes,
### request VOs, and response envelope) against whichever core engine is
### currently running on http://localhost:8080 (see
### example_config/application_dev.yml). Fiber and Gin are alternate core
### engines for the same app — run one at a time.
